    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "xychart",
      "title": "城市騎乘趨勢 · 每月租借車次",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "youbike-postgres"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "postgres",
            "uid": "youbike-postgres"
          },
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "WITH sequenced AS (\n    SELECT month, rentals,\n           extract(year FROM month)::integer * 12 + extract(month FROM month)::integer\n             - row_number() OVER (ORDER BY month) AS segment\n    FROM official_monthly_rentals\n)\nSELECT month::timestamp AT TIME ZONE 'Asia/Taipei' AS time,\n       rentals AS \"租借車次\",\n       to_char(min(month) OVER (PARTITION BY segment), 'YYYY-MM') || '起連續月份' AS \"連續月份段\"\nFROM sequenced\nORDER BY month"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "locale",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#32D5C5"
          },
          "custom": {
            "show": "points+lines",
            "pointShape": "circle",
            "pointSize": {
              "fixed": 7
            },
            "pointStrokeWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 90,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "lineStyle": {
              "fill": "solid"
            },
            "axisLabel": "租借車次（車次）",
            "axisPlacement": "left",
            "axisGridShow": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "time"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "time:YYYY-MM"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                "value": "官方月份（臺灣時間）"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "bottom"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "租借車次"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "min",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "mapping": "auto",
        "series": [
          {
            "x": {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "time"
              }
            },
            "y": {
              "matcher": {
                "id": "byName",
                "options": "租借車次"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "maxWidth": 420
        }
      },
      "description": "圓點為官方租借車次；2025-10與2026-01在本次資料集未列資源，各連續月份分段呈現。滑過圓點可查看精確值。",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "partitionByValues",
          "options": {
            "fields": [
              "連續月份段"
            ],
            "keepFields": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "官方全市月報來源",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "[臺中市政府交通局租賃月報 · 資料集88614](https://data.gov.tw/dataset/88614)\n\n僅取「臺中市／月／公共自行租賃情形－租借車次」，單位：車次。依政府資料開放授權條款第1版使用。\n\n本頁是隨專案附帶的官方已發布月份快照，不會自動下載新月報。缺月以「未發布（本次核對未列）」標示，不補零、不推估；下表可連至每月原始JSON。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "本機站點觀測來源",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "[臺中市政府 YouBike站況 · 資料集136781](https://data.gov.tw/dataset/136781)\n\n單站歷史從本機首次成功採集開始累積；觀測期間見下方。站點車數與空位觀測不等於實際租借車次，也不用來推算官方月報。\n\n[站點總覽](/d/taichung-youbike/taichung-youbike) · [早晚尖峰與單站歷史](/d/taichung-youbike-peaks/taichung-youbike)"
      }
    },
